abstract: >+
  This repository provides scripts for converting images
  captured by the Insta360 ONE omnidirectional camera,
  originally in Adobe Digital Negative (DNG) format, into
  their effective spectral radiance equivalents. The
  camera's RGB sensor features three spectral bands
  corresponding to the visible spectrum, allowing for
  radiance computation across the red, green, and blue
  channels.

